# Runtime data. The SIEM database holds password hashes, MFA secrets and
# the audit trail: one `git add -A` from a developer's machine would
# publish all of it. Never tracked. (v3.2 audit finding #14 — the
# database WAS committable before this rule existed.)
data/
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

